    "final_answer": "I have all the information needed. Let me compile the final answer.\n\n## Summary\n\n**Base Model (cheapest): MacBook Pro 14-inch with M3 chip**\n- Price: **$1,599.00**\n- 8-core CPU, 10-core GPU, 16-core Neural Engine\n- 8GB unified memory\n- 512GB SSD storage\n- 70W USB-C Power Adapter\n\n**Available Upgrade Options:**\n\n| Category | Options | Additional Cost |\n|----------|---------|-----------------|\n| Memory | 8GB (default) | $0 |\n| | 16GB unified memory | +$200 |\n| | **24GB unified memory** | **+$400** |\n| Storage | 512GB (default) | $0 |\n| | 1TB SSD | +$200 |\n| | **2TB SSD** | **+$600** |\n| Power Adapter | 70W USB-C (default) | $0 |\n| | **96W USB-C** | **+$20** |\n| Pre-Installed Software | Final Cut Pro | +$299.99 *(excluded)* |\n| | Logic Pro | +$199.99 *(excluded)* |\n\n**Maximum Upgrade Calculation (excluding Pre-Installed Software):**\n- Memory upgrade to 24GB: **+$400**\n- Storage upgrade to 2TB: **+$600**\n- Power Adapter upgrade to 96W: **+$20**\n\n**Total price difference from base model to maximum upgrade = $400 + $600 + $20 = $1,020.00**\n\n- Base model price: $1,599.00\n- Maximum upgraded price: $1,599.00 + $1,020.00 = **$2,619.00**\n- **Price difference: $1,020.00**",
